{
  "start": "prologue_ticket",
  "ambient": [
    {"min_danger": 1, "text": "翻页声停了一拍，像在等你呼吸。"},
    {"min_danger": 2, "text": "广播念到一个号码，尾音像咬住了你的后颈。"},
    {"min_danger": 3, "text": "风只吹在你左耳，右耳像贴着另一道呼吸。"},
    {"min_danger": 4, "text": "你低头时，地上影子比人多一个。"}
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "prologue_ticket",
      "text": [
        "夜里 11:30。",
        "自动门在你身后合上。",
        "分诊台没有人，一台吐号机自己吐出一张纸。",
        "你捡起号码：{{player_ticket}}。"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"text": "走进大厅", "next": "entrance"},
        {"text": "把号码扔掉", "next": "entrance_throw", "effects": [{"op":"inc","var":"danger","value":1}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "entrance_throw",
      "text": [
        "号码落地前又回到你鞋尖，纸面朝上。",
        "字迹更深了：{{player_ticket}}。"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"text": "弯腰捡起", "next": "entrance"},
        {"text": "踩住它往前走", "next": "entrance", "effects": [{"op":"inc","var":"danger","value":1}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "entrance",
      "text": [
        "大厅比白天窄，灯一盏亮一盏灭。",
        "一条队伍从吐号机前排到窗口。",
        "没有人交谈，只有纸页摩擦声。"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"text": "站到队尾", "next": "queue_intro"},
        {"text": "先沿墙观察", "next": "observe_hall", "effects": [{"op":"inc","var":"danger","value":1}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "queue_intro",
      "text": [
        "你身前有五个人。",
        "他们都朝着窗口，肩膀一动不动。",
        "你手里的号码纸有点潮。"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"text": "跟着队伍移动", "next": "gap_event", "effects": [{"op":"dec","var":"queue_count","value":1}]},
        {"text": "抬头看灯管", "next": "observe_hall"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "observe_hall",
      "text": [
        "你数了天花板灯管，七根。",
        "再抬头，变成八根。",
        "香炉里有灰，却闻不到香味。"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"text": "回到队伍", "next": "gap_event", "effects": [{"op":"dec","var":"queue_count","value":1}]},
        {"text": "继续数第二遍", "next": "gap_event", "effects": [{"op":"inc","var":"danger","value":1},{"op":"dec","var":"queue_count","value":1}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gap_event",
      "text": [
        "穿校服的少年忽然被带向侧门。",
        "你前方空出一个位置。",
        "队伍停住了，没人补上。"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"text": "补上空位", "next": "death_replace", "effects": [{"op":"set","var":"filled_gap","value":true},{"op":"set","var":"replaced","value":true},{"op":"inc","var":"danger","value":2}]},
        {"text": "留在原地", "next": "steps_event"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "steps_event",
      "text": [
        "脚步声应该是：哒、哒、哒。",
        "你前面那双鞋却没有声音，像悬着。"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"text": "继续跟着", "next": "death_wrong_queue", "effects": [{"op":"set","var":"replaced","value":true},{"op":"inc","var":"danger","value":2}]},
        {"text": "后退一步", "next": "window_event", "effects": [{"op":"dec","var":"queue_count","value":1}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "window_event",
      "text": [
        "两个窗口并排。",
        "左侧亮灯，牌子写着夜诊，排着三人。",
        "右侧黑着，玻璃后有模糊的人影。"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"text": "排亮灯窗口", "next": "number_call", "effects": [{"op":"inc","var":"danger","value":2}]},
        {"text": "排黑灯窗口", "next": "number_call"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "number_call",
      "on_enter": [{"op":"inc","var":"danger","value":1}],
      "text": [
        "你还没看见叫号屏。",
        "窗口里的人却先开口：",
        "“{{player_ticket}}，到你了。”"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"text": "答应并上前", "next": "death_registered", "effects": [{"op":"set","var":"responded_number","value":true},{"op":"set","var":"replaced","value":true}]},
        {"text": "不作声，盯着她的手", "next": "ticket_swap"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ticket_swap",
      "text": [
        "老人回头递来一张号码牌：27。",
        "“我排不动了，换你。”",
        "他举着纸，手臂像不会酸。"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"text": "接过号码牌", "next": "death_exchange", "effects": [{"op":"set","var":"took_ticket","value":true},{"op":"set","var":"replaced","value":true}]},
        {"text": "拒绝，把手藏进口袋", "next": "leave_or_stay", "effects": [{"op":"dec","var":"queue_count","value":1}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "leave_or_stay",
      "text": [
        "门外天色发白。",
        "你回头时，队伍像比刚才更短。"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "现在离开医院",
          "next": "ending_hidden",
          "conditions": [
            {"var":"queue_count","op":"equals","value":3},
            {"var":"filled_gap","op":"equals","value":false},
            {"var":"responded_number","op":"equals","value":false},
            {"var":"took_ticket","op":"equals","value":false}
          ]
        },
        {"text": "继续排下去", "next": "ending_normal_leave", "effects": [{"op":"inc","var":"danger","value":1}]},
        {"text": "转身离开", "next": "ending_normal_leave"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "death_replace",
      "text": [
        "你踩进空位。",
        "队伍重新流动，前面的人一个个消失。",
        "窗口里的人翻了一页：",
        "“{{player_ticket}}，终于轮到你。”"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"text": "抬头看她", "next": "afterlife_desk"},
        {"text": "低头看号码纸", "next": "afterlife_desk", "effects": [{"op":"inc","var":"danger","value":1}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "death_wrong_queue",
      "text": [
        "你跟着无声的鞋底走了三步。",
        "你才意识到，整条队伍只有你在呼吸。",
        "他们一起回头，脸像蒙着磨砂玻璃。"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"text": "闭眼", "next": "afterlife_desk"},
        {"text": "继续看着他们", "next": "afterlife_desk", "effects": [{"op":"inc","var":"danger","value":1}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "death_registered",
      "text": [
        "窗口推来一张表。",
        "编号：{{player_ticket}}",
        "状态：已接入。",
        "大厅里的人都不再看你。"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"text": "按下手印", "next": "afterlife_desk"},
        {"text": "把纸推回去", "next": "afterlife_desk", "effects": [{"op":"inc","var":"danger","value":1}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "death_exchange",
      "text": [
        "你接过那张牌。",
        "再低头时，27 变成了 {{player_ticket}}。",
        "老人已经不在原地。"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"text": "攥紧号码牌", "next": "afterlife_desk"},
        {"text": "把号码牌丢开", "next": "afterlife_desk", "effects": [{"op":"inc","var":"danger","value":1}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "afterlife_desk",
      "text": [
        "你还站在大厅里，却听不见自己的呼吸。",
        "窗口递出一张工牌。",
        "上面写着：分流 {{player_ticket}}。"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {"text": "回到门口等待下一位", "next": "ending_replaced"},
        {"text": "站在窗口后面", "next": "ending_replaced", "effects": [{"op":"inc","var":"danger","value":1}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ending_replaced",
      "ending": true,
      "text": [
        "自动门再次打开。",
        "一个陌生人走进来。",
        "他低头看着手里的纸：{{player_ticket}}。"
      ],
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ending_hidden",
      "ending": true,
      "text": [
        "你离开医院时，天刚亮。",
        "门口公告栏贴着旧纸，边角都发黑。",
        "你没停下看完，手心里的号码却一直是湿的。"
      ],
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ending_normal_leave",
      "ending": true,
      "text": [
        "你走出大厅，后背发冷。",
        "街口风一吹，你才发现掌心还攥着那张号码纸。"
      ],
      "choices": []
    }
  ]
}
